  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender, Leadership II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender, Ledarskap II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja ett h&#xf6;gre delgande av kvinnor i politiken. Aktiviteterna deltar b&#xe5;de m&#xe4;n o kvin.  Studiebes&#xf6;k i Sverige ing&#xe5;r samt konferens i Ukraina,  f&#xf6;rutom sem i Mold. Svensk part Spr&#xe5;ngbr&#xe4;dan,mold part UNDP/Gid</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective is to increase women participation in politics. In the activities both women and men participate. Seminars, study visit to Swe and conf in Kiev. Spr&#xe5;ngbr&#xe4;dan swedisn partner and UNDP/GiD  in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
